WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:01.980
Why?!

00:00:01.980 --> 00:00:03.980
The stage for <i>Full Moon</i>'s first solo live concert...

00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:05.440
All of a sudden, we couldn't use it!

00:00:05.440 --> 00:00:09.280
Someone pretended to be 
on the staff and canceled it!

00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:11.820
Unfortunately, the live performance was to be postponed...

00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:12.490
But...

00:00:12.490 --> 00:00:14.080
...by using a boat as the stage...

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:15.520
...the live concert was a success!

00:00:15.550 --> 00:00:17.090
Under the evening sky, on the last day of summer break...

00:00:17.090 --> 00:00:19.990
...<i>Full Moon</i>  shone with all of her beauty!

00:00:20.340 --> 00:00:21.070
Well, then...

00:00:21.070 --> 00:00:22.870
...I wonder what's going to happen today.

00:00:22.870 --> 00:00:23.500
Huh?

00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:29.090
Do you understand?

00:00:29.090 --> 00:00:29.730
Yes.

00:02:23.860 --> 00:02:25.610
Isn't it over?!

00:02:25.610 --> 00:02:27.320
Hurry! Hurry!

00:02:27.320 --> 00:02:29.440
What's wrong with you two?

00:02:29.440 --> 00:02:30.500
Bathroom?

00:02:30.500 --> 00:02:31.160
Ah.

00:02:44.390 --> 00:02:45.470
Okay.

00:02:45.470 --> 00:02:47.220
Great job, <i>Full Moon</i>-san.

00:02:47.220 --> 00:02:48.010
Ah. Yes.

00:02:48.010 --> 00:02:49.220
Thank you very much!

00:02:49.930 --> 00:02:51.280
Okay, it's over.

00:02:52.390 --> 00:02:54.230
Thanks for your help!

00:02:53.600 --> 00:02:54.830
Good work!

00:02:54.230 --> 00:02:55.100
Good work!!

00:02:58.350 --> 00:02:59.900
Ooshige-san, let's go back!

00:02:59.900 --> 00:03:01.690
Eh... ah... w-wait!

00:03:02.070 --> 00:03:03.610
What's going on?!

00:03:03.610 --> 00:03:05.490
Tell me why!

00:03:05.490 --> 00:03:06.950
Didn't we tell you?

00:03:06.950 --> 00:03:09.760
They've been really strict as of late at her house.

00:03:10.910 --> 00:03:13.740
You were out later than the curfew we agreed upon.

00:03:13.740 --> 00:03:15.250
I'm sorry.

00:03:15.250 --> 00:03:17.750
Even if you're visiting your friends' house...

00:03:17.750 --> 00:03:20.710
...staying too long just troubles them even more.

00:03:21.220 --> 00:03:21.790
That's all.

00:03:21.790 --> 00:03:23.170
Be more careful.

00:03:24.590 --> 00:03:25.530
Okay.

00:03:38.310 --> 00:03:40.960
Well, then... I have to go shopping...

00:03:41.780 --> 00:03:42.460
Ah.

00:03:45.320 --> 00:03:46.920
Dr. Wakaouji.

00:03:47.610 --> 00:03:49.150
He's so wonderful.

00:03:51.580 --> 00:03:53.030
Hello? Mitsuki?

00:03:53.030 --> 00:03:54.660
Yes. Good morning!

00:03:55.390 --> 00:03:57.380
Hey, Mitsuki. Whatcha up to?

00:03:57.380 --> 00:03:58.250
Eh?

00:03:58.250 --> 00:04:02.150
I'm playing with the accessory from the last concert.

00:04:02.670 --> 00:04:03.960
Is there any work?

00:04:03.960 --> 00:04:05.300
Not really, but...

00:04:05.300 --> 00:04:06.000
...just a little something.

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:06.420
Eh?

00:04:06.420 --> 00:04:07.570
What is it?

00:04:08.390 --> 00:04:10.260
What do you think it is?

00:04:10.260 --> 00:04:11.010
Come on!

00:04:11.010 --> 00:04:12.720
What is it?

00:04:12.720 --> 00:04:14.730
Can you come out right now?

00:04:14.730 --> 00:04:17.680
I'll be in the area soon.

00:04:17.910 --> 00:04:21.260
Oh... if possible, could you bring 
Takuto-kun and Meroko-chan along?

00:04:21.260 --> 00:04:22.030
See you later!

00:04:22.030 --> 00:04:22.810
Ah!

00:04:23.040 --> 00:04:24.190
Hello?

00:04:24.190 --> 00:04:25.530
Hello? Ooshige-san?

00:04:25.530 --> 00:04:26.570
Hello?!

00:04:27.990 --> 00:04:30.200
You've moved here...?!

00:04:30.200 --> 00:04:30.720
Yep!

00:04:32.700 --> 00:04:34.780
If I live closer to you...

00:04:34.780 --> 00:04:37.830
...it'll be easier for you to get out, right?

00:04:38.020 --> 00:04:39.570
I see how it is.

00:04:39.570 --> 00:04:41.330
Only the best from a manager!

00:04:41.330 --> 00:04:42.940
I suppose so...

00:04:44.210 --> 00:04:46.130
Uh... where do you want this?

00:04:46.130 --> 00:04:46.670
Ah.

00:04:46.670 --> 00:04:48.450
The room over there, please.

00:04:48.450 --> 00:04:50.630
Put that in the corner over there, please.

00:04:50.630 --> 00:04:51.220
Okay.

00:04:52.810 --> 00:04:54.680
Quite a big place, isn't it?

00:04:54.680 --> 00:04:56.680
A manager can afford something like this, huh?

00:04:56.680 --> 00:04:59.230
Oh, the rent isn't that much...{shani: Ah! Now I see where Furumuun's money is being spent! Ooshige-san, you are... just kidding! Ooshige is <3}

00:04:59.230 --> 00:05:01.140
...compared to living in the city.

00:05:01.400 --> 00:05:02.410
Ah...

00:05:02.410 --> 00:05:03.600
Is that so...

00:05:03.600 --> 00:05:07.380
Now I can give you even more support than before, Mitsuki.

00:05:07.950 --> 00:05:09.530
If the place is this big...

00:05:09.530 --> 00:05:12.280
...we can even have a room just for you, Mitsuki.

00:05:12.280 --> 00:05:13.200
For me?

00:05:13.200 --> 00:05:13.760
Yep.

00:05:15.870 --> 00:05:18.660
We can use this room for 
singing lessons and such.

00:05:18.970 --> 00:05:22.100
You can use this room to be alone while you're writing lyrics, too.

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:24.900
Wow!

00:05:25.420 --> 00:05:26.400
Ah!

00:05:28.760 --> 00:05:31.380
It's completely soundproof.

00:05:31.660 --> 00:05:34.640
It's like a private studio for <i>Full Moon</i> !

00:05:34.640 --> 00:05:36.900
Makes her look like a professional artist...!

00:05:36.900 --> 00:05:39.070
Our girl here is a professional, you know...

00:05:39.070 --> 00:05:41.050
I still have a ways to go though, right?

00:05:41.050 --> 00:05:42.360
Ooshige-san.

00:05:42.360 --> 00:05:44.140
Doing all this for me... thank you!

00:05:44.140 --> 00:05:46.460
Oh come on... it's nothing... it's nothing...

00:05:52.570 --> 00:05:54.220
This was my dream.

00:05:54.220 --> 00:05:56.030
A room with an ocean view... {that's a tad anticlimactic}{shani: of course, and to spend the rest of her life with a certain former member of Route L. :D}

00:05:59.740 --> 00:06:02.080
What... so it was for herself, after all.

00:06:02.080 --> 00:06:03.910
Well, I guess that's how it is.

00:06:08.920 --> 00:06:12.300
So this is why she actually bothered to invite us?

00:06:12.300 --> 00:06:15.530
Geez, I wonder what she thinks Shinigami are?!

00:06:17.720 --> 00:06:18.700
Crap!

00:06:19.770 --> 00:06:20.390
Huh?

00:06:21.190 --> 00:06:22.410
Excuse me.

00:06:22.410 --> 00:06:24.100
You dropped something.

00:06:32.490 --> 00:06:33.110
Huh?

00:06:33.420 --> 00:06:34.840
That's...

00:06:36.240 --> 00:06:37.580
Thank you for your help.

00:06:37.580 --> 00:06:38.450
No problem.

00:06:38.450 --> 00:06:39.890
I'll leave these in the cart.

00:06:41.040 --> 00:06:42.390
That's Mitsuki-chan...

00:06:42.750 --> 00:06:44.680
I wonder what she's doing here.

00:06:45.040 --> 00:06:47.400
Anyways, I have to report this to the madam... {shani: Tanaka-san on high alert!}

00:06:48.000 --> 00:06:48.840
That's right.

00:06:48.840 --> 00:06:50.290
You guys aren't the only ones...

00:06:50.290 --> 00:06:52.170
I called someone else to come help, too.

00:06:52.170 --> 00:06:52.510
Eh?

00:06:52.510 --> 00:06:53.700
Who is it?

00:06:53.700 --> 00:06:54.340
Ah.

00:06:54.340 --> 00:06:55.090
He's here!

00:06:55.090 --> 00:06:55.740
Hmm?

00:06:55.740 --> 00:06:56.510
Ah!

00:06:57.970 --> 00:06:59.430
Wakaouji-sensei!

00:07:00.560 --> 00:07:02.890
By helper, she meant you, Wakaouji-sensei?

00:07:02.890 --> 00:07:03.940
Helper?

00:07:03.940 --> 00:07:05.460
Thanks for coming!

00:07:06.610 --> 00:07:08.900
You can park in the back.

00:07:08.900 --> 00:07:10.440
U-Um...

00:07:10.440 --> 00:07:12.590
That important business you mentioned is...?

00:07:13.030 --> 00:07:14.450
Sorry about that.

00:07:14.450 --> 00:07:16.320
We need a man's help here.

00:07:16.620 --> 00:07:18.300
Huh... sure...

00:07:18.820 --> 00:07:20.740
She's a sly one, that woman...

00:07:20.740 --> 00:07:22.630
If she wasn't so pushy...

00:07:22.630 --> 00:07:24.870
...she wouldn't make it as a manager, right?

00:07:24.870 --> 00:07:26.920
B-But... is this okay?

00:07:26.920 --> 00:07:29.790
Being a guy, I'd probably mess up... moving a girl's belongings... {shani: my 100 bucks on you ending up with ooshige-san, Wakaouji! You two are just made for one another!}

00:07:29.790 --> 00:07:32.880
Wh-Why is Dr. Wakaouji here...?

00:07:33.100 --> 00:07:35.840
After all, we do have a relationship.

00:07:35.840 --> 00:07:38.300
A-A relationship?!

00:07:38.300 --> 00:07:39.330
Yeah...

00:07:39.330 --> 00:07:41.560
I'm not sure if I'll be of much help, though.

00:07:41.560 --> 00:07:42.670
Yay!

00:07:42.670 --> 00:07:45.350
Wakaouji-sensei's helping out too!

00:07:46.150 --> 00:07:47.910
I'll go park my car, then.

00:07:48.850 --> 00:07:50.110
That woman...

00:07:50.110 --> 00:07:52.920
Just how is she related to Dr. Wakaouji?

00:08:01.450 --> 00:08:02.280
U-Um...

00:08:02.280 --> 00:08:03.410
Do you need help with that?

00:08:03.410 --> 00:08:05.350
I-I've got it covered!

00:08:06.830 --> 00:08:08.600
There, see.

00:08:14.670 --> 00:08:15.720
Let's see.

00:08:15.720 --> 00:08:17.050
Shinigami-kun...

00:08:17.050 --> 00:08:19.010
...I'd like to move this over there.

00:08:19.010 --> 00:08:21.030
Ah... th-thanks...

00:08:23.850 --> 00:08:27.020
Softly... softly...

00:08:28.730 --> 00:08:32.060
Being so friendly with my Dr. Wakaouji...

00:08:32.060 --> 00:08:34.420
I'm going to find out who she really is.

00:08:35.820 --> 00:08:36.610
Man...

00:08:36.610 --> 00:08:38.570
Looks like we managed to put everything in order.

00:08:38.570 --> 00:08:39.110
Yep.

00:08:39.110 --> 00:08:40.700
You were a huge help!

00:08:40.720 --> 00:08:42.530
Really... thank you so much!

00:08:42.530 --> 00:08:43.040
Not at all.

00:08:43.040 --> 00:08:44.890
I'm glad I was able to help.

00:08:45.290 --> 00:08:48.210
Why are they so close?

00:08:48.210 --> 00:08:49.890
So those two really are...

00:08:49.890 --> 00:08:51.020
Tanaka-san!

00:08:52.050 --> 00:08:53.640
W-Why are you here..?

00:08:55.090 --> 00:08:56.480
What is it, Mitsuki?

00:08:56.480 --> 00:08:57.880
Who is this person?

00:08:57.880 --> 00:08:58.340
Ah.

00:08:58.340 --> 00:08:59.300
Tanaka-san!

00:08:59.300 --> 00:09:00.770
Tanaka-san is...

00:09:00.770 --> 00:09:03.090
The housekeeper at Mitsuki-chan's home.

00:09:03.090 --> 00:09:04.300
This isn't good...

00:09:04.300 --> 00:09:05.140
It's bad?

00:09:05.140 --> 00:09:06.480
Of course it is!

00:09:06.480 --> 00:09:09.640
If this girl's relationship with her manager is discovered...

00:09:09.640 --> 00:09:10.560
I see.

00:09:10.560 --> 00:09:11.430
Tanaka-san!

00:09:11.430 --> 00:09:12.440
Um...

00:09:12.440 --> 00:09:14.060
This is, well...

00:09:14.060 --> 00:09:15.480
Dr. Wakaouji!

00:09:15.480 --> 00:09:16.940
Y-Yes!

00:09:16.960 --> 00:09:18.360
Dr. Wakaouji!

00:09:18.360 --> 00:09:19.860
You had a fiancée?!

00:09:19.860 --> 00:09:21.820
Fiancée?!

00:09:23.120 --> 00:09:24.780
You mean me?

00:09:26.080 --> 00:09:27.490
Huh?!

00:09:27.490 --> 00:09:30.700
Dr. Wakaouji was who I longed for...

00:09:30.700 --> 00:09:32.340
All I dreamed for...

00:09:32.340 --> 00:09:34.290
All I hoped for...

00:09:34.290 --> 00:09:36.350
U-Um... Tanaka-san?

00:09:36.350 --> 00:09:38.050
Let's settle down here.

00:09:38.050 --> 00:09:40.760
Ooshige-san is nothing of the sort.

00:09:41.120 --> 00:09:43.720
Geez... what's going on..?

00:09:43.720 --> 00:09:44.820
Is that so?

00:09:45.270 --> 00:09:46.570
I understand.

00:09:47.680 --> 00:09:49.180
To make up for this...

00:09:49.850 --> 00:09:51.370
...I challenge you!

00:09:52.180 --> 00:09:53.040
What?!

00:09:54.100 --> 00:09:56.320
The one who suits Dr. Wakaouji...

00:09:56.320 --> 00:09:58.600
...must cook... do laundry... clean...

00:09:58.600 --> 00:10:01.570
A bride that can do everything perfectly!

00:10:01.570 --> 00:10:03.660
To decide which one of us is more suitable...

00:10:03.660 --> 00:10:05.610
...let us have a battle!

00:10:07.790 --> 00:10:09.410
Dr. Wakaouji...

00:10:09.410 --> 00:10:12.600
Do I have no other alternative but to accept this challenge?

00:10:13.460 --> 00:10:16.270
If that will calm Tanaka-san down...

00:10:17.590 --> 00:10:18.880
All right!

00:10:18.880 --> 00:10:21.000
Things are starting to heat up!

00:10:21.000 --> 00:10:23.550
This is getting out of hand again...

00:10:23.900 --> 00:10:24.710
Come!

00:10:24.710 --> 00:10:26.620
Let's settle this fair and square!

00:10:26.620 --> 00:10:28.680
Fine... we'll do it your way!

00:10:44.450 --> 00:10:45.700
Tanaka-san? {Sometimes lunar timing is boring}

00:10:45.700 --> 00:10:47.030
Tanaka-san?! {shani: there you go! :D}

00:10:50.990 --> 00:10:52.490
That's strange...

00:10:52.490 --> 00:10:55.660
She hasn't come back from shopping yet...

00:11:04.880 --> 00:11:06.970
A requirement for being a good bride... {shani: man, she is loving it!}

00:11:06.970 --> 00:11:09.640
...is being able to make a delicious miso soup.

00:11:10.310 --> 00:11:11.100
Here you go, Mitsuki.

00:11:11.100 --> 00:11:11.600
Eh?

00:11:11.600 --> 00:11:12.240
Ah.

00:11:13.270 --> 00:11:15.390
Miso Showdown! Start!

00:11:45.010 --> 00:11:46.300
Your miso!

00:11:46.300 --> 00:11:46.970
How do you like that?!

00:11:46.970 --> 00:11:47.590
You little...

00:11:47.590 --> 00:11:48.590
More!

00:11:48.590 --> 00:11:49.880
Had enough?

00:11:49.880 --> 00:11:51.550
It's done.

00:11:54.230 --> 00:11:55.940
Here you go.

00:11:55.940 --> 00:11:57.120
Wow!

00:11:58.270 --> 00:11:59.620
Let's eat!

00:11:58.270 --> 00:11:59.620
Let's eat!

00:12:03.360 --> 00:12:04.550
It's delicious.

00:12:05.910 --> 00:12:07.190
It's really good.

00:12:14.230 --> 00:12:16.050
{shani: Ooshige-san Kawaii! <3}

00:12:25.770 --> 00:12:26.980
What is it?!

00:12:26.980 --> 00:12:29.130
What's wrong, you guys?!

00:12:36.890 --> 00:12:38.600
Well... you do live alone...

00:12:38.600 --> 00:12:41.060
You probably can't win at cooking...

00:12:43.610 --> 00:12:45.820
Next up is the Cleaning Battle!

00:12:46.190 --> 00:12:47.190
Ready...

00:12:47.190 --> 00:12:48.360
Start!

00:12:55.200 --> 00:12:57.410
I'll be fine at this.

00:12:58.200 --> 00:12:58.950
Huh?

00:12:59.450 --> 00:13:00.370
Huh, huh?

00:13:01.040 --> 00:13:01.790
Ah...

00:13:11.760 --> 00:13:12.800
Okay.

00:13:12.800 --> 00:13:14.590
I'm done.

00:13:16.100 --> 00:13:17.140
Ah!

00:13:17.140 --> 00:13:19.640
I'm not done yet!

00:13:25.020 --> 00:13:25.900
All right!

00:13:25.900 --> 00:13:28.400
Next up is the Laundry Royale!

00:13:28.400 --> 00:13:30.030
And...

00:13:30.400 --> 00:13:31.530
Start!

00:13:33.990 --> 00:13:34.990
What is this?!

00:13:34.990 --> 00:13:37.870
Why would anyone scrub clothes
 in this day and age?!

00:13:48.630 --> 00:13:49.250
There.

00:13:49.250 --> 00:13:50.210
I'm finished.

00:13:54.630 --> 00:13:55.510
Ooshige-san...

00:13:55.510 --> 00:13:57.300
...are you okay?

00:13:57.300 --> 00:13:58.810
My arms...

00:13:58.810 --> 00:14:00.600
I can't lift them...

00:14:02.520 --> 00:14:03.770
Ah! Okay!

00:14:03.770 --> 00:14:04.980
I can't stand this any longer!

00:14:05.520 --> 00:14:06.810
Take this!

00:14:07.480 --> 00:14:08.900
Here I go!

00:14:12.280 --> 00:14:14.280
What's with the wind all of a sudden?!

00:14:14.280 --> 00:14:15.530
And it's so hot...!

00:14:15.910 --> 00:14:17.370
Me-Meroko!

00:14:17.370 --> 00:14:18.780
You're overdoing it!

00:14:18.780 --> 00:14:21.740
I'll dry it faster for her this way.

00:14:21.740 --> 00:14:23.370
Power up!

00:14:33.920 --> 00:14:34.840
Ah!

00:14:34.840 --> 00:14:36.340
The clothes I just washed...!

00:14:36.340 --> 00:14:38.010
W-What?

00:14:38.010 --> 00:14:39.800
How... what just happened?

00:14:39.800 --> 00:14:41.500
I overdid it... maybe... {alpha}

00:14:41.500 --> 00:14:42.430
I overdid it... maybe... {alpha}

00:14:47.650 --> 00:14:48.980
So...

00:14:48.980 --> 00:14:51.230
...it is really impossible for me...

00:14:52.110 --> 00:14:55.570
...to make delicious food for my husband...

00:14:55.990 --> 00:14:58.200
...or iron shirts for him....

00:14:58.870 --> 00:15:01.950
We'll have fun shopping on the weekends...

00:15:01.950 --> 00:15:04.370
...a warm, pleasant atmosphere in our house...

00:15:04.370 --> 00:15:06.080
...with lots of friends...

00:15:06.620 --> 00:15:08.670
But... but...

00:15:08.670 --> 00:15:11.540
It's hopeless!

00:15:12.300 --> 00:15:13.000
Besides...

00:15:13.000 --> 00:15:15.510
My purpose in life isn't to become a good bride!

00:15:15.820 --> 00:15:16.380
That's okay!

00:15:16.380 --> 00:15:18.260
So what if I live alone for the rest of my life...!

00:15:18.260 --> 00:15:19.640
Even if I'm accused of failing 
to carry on the family...!

00:15:19.640 --> 00:15:21.970
Even if they say I'm weird at work...!

00:15:21.970 --> 00:15:26.100
Even if I have to live a cruel life off a pension...!

00:15:26.390 --> 00:15:30.650
Even if I end up as a plain old cranky woman...!

00:15:32.440 --> 00:15:34.650
C-Calm down, Ooshige-san...

00:15:34.650 --> 00:15:36.530
That's a roundabout way to put it, but...

00:15:36.530 --> 00:15:39.110
...that means that you've given up, right?

00:15:41.450 --> 00:15:44.080
If you'll accept that...

00:15:44.080 --> 00:15:45.200
Hold on!

00:15:45.200 --> 00:15:46.370
Is it okay to leave things like this?!

00:15:46.370 --> 00:15:47.840
Isn't this mortifying?!

00:15:48.660 --> 00:15:50.040
Excuse me for intruding...

00:15:50.250 --> 00:15:53.290
Honestly, young people these days...

00:15:53.290 --> 00:15:56.050
Their parents don't teach them anything.

00:15:56.630 --> 00:15:58.840
How pathetic.

00:16:00.050 --> 00:16:01.050
Hold it!

00:16:01.050 --> 00:16:03.930
This has nothing to do with my parents, does it?!

00:16:04.310 --> 00:16:05.140
Are you sure?

00:16:05.390 --> 00:16:07.430
If your parents had brought you up properly...

00:16:07.430 --> 00:16:10.190
...I'm sure this would have been more of a challenge.

00:16:10.190 --> 00:16:10.900
Cooking!

00:16:10.900 --> 00:16:11.690
Laundry!

00:16:11.690 --> 00:16:12.310
Cleaning!

00:16:12.310 --> 00:16:13.520
And not just those...

00:16:13.520 --> 00:16:14.440
Sewing!

00:16:14.440 --> 00:16:15.320
Evening drinks!

00:16:15.320 --> 00:16:16.190
Taking a child to the park for the first time!

00:16:16.190 --> 00:16:18.690
Can you handle all of those?!

00:16:21.450 --> 00:16:22.660
Next match!

00:16:22.660 --> 00:16:24.620
That's the spirit!

00:16:24.620 --> 00:16:25.910
Ooshige-san...

00:16:25.910 --> 00:16:27.370
Isn't this interesting?

00:16:27.370 --> 00:16:30.120
In that case, if you win this time around...

00:16:30.120 --> 00:16:31.870
...I'll give you four points.

00:16:32.170 --> 00:16:33.330
She's so calm...

00:16:33.330 --> 00:16:35.500
Like there's no way she'll lose...

00:16:35.500 --> 00:16:36.840
But if she wins...

00:16:39.510 --> 00:16:41.880
...it'll be a comeback victory for Ooshige-san!

00:16:42.300 --> 00:16:44.260
I'll definitely show you that I can win!

00:16:44.680 --> 00:16:46.970
The final one is a Shopping Contest.

00:16:49.730 --> 00:16:51.020
Ingredients for sukiyaki!

00:16:51.020 --> 00:16:54.270
Whoever gets them cheaper within thirty minutes wins!

00:16:55.190 --> 00:16:56.650
That's fine!

00:16:56.650 --> 00:16:57.730
I'll show you...!

00:16:57.730 --> 00:16:58.820
Which means...

00:16:58.820 --> 00:17:01.030
The final round is a Sukiyaki Contest!

00:17:01.030 --> 00:17:02.700
Ah... I need some sort of bell...

00:17:02.700 --> 00:17:03.740
Ah... just leave it!

00:17:03.740 --> 00:17:05.410
We're going too!

00:17:05.410 --> 00:17:06.240
U-Um!

00:17:11.660 --> 00:17:12.870
Excuse me.

00:17:12.870 --> 00:17:14.000
Welcome!

00:17:14.230 --> 00:17:16.380
Could I have some sukiyaki meat, please?

00:17:16.380 --> 00:17:18.000
Sukiyaki... that would be beef, right?

00:17:18.000 --> 00:17:18.920
Coming right up!

00:17:18.920 --> 00:17:20.210
Ah... Mister.

00:17:20.210 --> 00:17:21.720
Could you knock a little off the price for me?

00:17:22.260 --> 00:17:24.840
Of course, for a beautiful lady like yourself...

00:17:24.840 --> 00:17:25.680
Really?

00:17:25.680 --> 00:17:27.600
Thanks, Mister!

00:17:28.850 --> 00:17:29.720
Hold it!

00:17:30.940 --> 00:17:31.520
You!

00:17:31.520 --> 00:17:33.810
You skipped work to play pachinko yesterday, didn't you?! {pachinko note is pointless}

00:17:33.810 --> 00:17:35.480
H-How do you..?

00:17:35.480 --> 00:17:37.360
Don't underestimate me.

00:17:37.360 --> 00:17:39.320
Last week, you made up a lie
 about an appointment...

00:17:39.320 --> 00:17:41.240
...and went to the races instead!

00:17:41.240 --> 00:17:43.200
Your wife's going to find out.

00:17:43.820 --> 00:17:45.110
Ah... um...

00:17:45.110 --> 00:17:47.370
How does thirty percent off sound?

00:17:48.740 --> 00:17:50.700
How about half off?

00:17:51.540 --> 00:17:53.460
P-Please, come again!

00:17:53.460 --> 00:17:56.170
Can't get anything past you, huh... Tanaka-san...

00:18:00.300 --> 00:18:00.920
Ah!

00:18:00.920 --> 00:18:01.460
This is cheap!

00:18:02.170 --> 00:18:03.170
Excuse me

00:18:03.170 --> 00:18:03.840
Yes ma'am!

00:18:04.050 --> 00:18:06.010
What's she doing at a fish store?

00:18:06.010 --> 00:18:07.260
Who knows...

00:18:09.680 --> 00:18:11.270
Um... Ooshige-san?

00:18:11.270 --> 00:18:11.810
Hmm?

00:18:11.810 --> 00:18:14.390
Oh... what's up, Mitsuki?

00:18:14.390 --> 00:18:16.690
For sukiyaki... fish is...

00:18:17.230 --> 00:18:18.110
What?!

00:18:18.110 --> 00:18:19.270
You don't need them?!

00:18:51.470 --> 00:18:53.710
What are they doing playing around for?

00:18:53.710 --> 00:18:57.060
There's no way she's never had sukiyaki before...

00:18:57.060 --> 00:18:58.310
No way...

00:18:58.310 --> 00:18:59.020
Ah.

00:18:59.020 --> 00:19:00.900
She's going for the milk now.

00:19:00.900 --> 00:19:01.770
After her!

00:19:11.870 --> 00:19:15.450
Looks like I've won this one, too.

00:19:15.450 --> 00:19:16.250
Ah?

00:19:17.160 --> 00:19:18.250
They're here, they're here...

00:19:22.800 --> 00:19:24.380
Dr. Wakaouji...

00:19:34.930 --> 00:19:37.520
But... do we have enough eggs?

00:19:37.520 --> 00:19:40.190
It feels like a fifteen-pack would have been better.

00:19:40.860 --> 00:19:41.610
No.

00:19:41.610 --> 00:19:43.770
Eggs are high in cholesterol.

00:19:43.770 --> 00:19:45.780
Just one for each person is enough. {shani: in case we didn't know, there is a magic box in this modern world, and we call it a refrigerator where we can keep tamago to iro iro tabemono itemu. :P}

00:19:47.150 --> 00:19:48.950
Just what a doctor would say.

00:19:48.950 --> 00:19:49.780
Not at all...

00:19:53.700 --> 00:19:57.330
Wha... what is... this...

00:19:58.410 --> 00:19:59.670
I understand.

00:20:00.210 --> 00:20:02.540
It's mortifying, but I must accept it.

00:20:05.840 --> 00:20:07.260
Sorry I took so long.

00:20:08.880 --> 00:20:10.260
You...

00:20:10.260 --> 00:20:11.140
Eh?

00:20:11.140 --> 00:20:12.180
But...

00:20:12.180 --> 00:20:14.430
...I made it within the time limit.

00:20:14.430 --> 00:20:15.810
I've lost.

00:20:16.310 --> 00:20:16.770
Eh?

00:20:18.020 --> 00:20:19.390
I concede.

00:20:20.480 --> 00:20:21.600
This match...

00:20:21.600 --> 00:20:22.770
...goes to you.

00:20:22.770 --> 00:20:23.560
Eh?!

00:20:23.560 --> 00:20:25.230
Ah... what do you mean?!

00:20:25.230 --> 00:20:26.480
You can't cook...

00:20:26.480 --> 00:20:27.740
Can't do laundry either...

00:20:27.740 --> 00:20:30.280
Can't clean or shop at all, either...

00:20:30.280 --> 00:20:31.410
Ooshige-san!

00:20:31.410 --> 00:20:33.070
But... the two of you...

00:20:33.660 --> 00:20:35.910
...look so good together...

00:20:43.920 --> 00:20:45.540
Well, have a happy life together!

00:20:45.540 --> 00:20:47.420
We'll be neighbors now.

00:20:47.420 --> 00:20:48.840
Let's get along.

00:20:58.770 --> 00:21:00.940
So what was the point again...

00:21:00.940 --> 00:21:02.310
...of everything that happened today..?

00:21:02.310 --> 00:21:03.440
Somehow...

00:21:03.440 --> 00:21:04.980
It all worked out, didn't it...

00:21:04.980 --> 00:21:05.730
Yes.

00:21:06.520 --> 00:21:10.240
Ooshige-san will be Mitsuki-chan's neighbor now.

00:21:11.150 --> 00:21:11.950
Ooshige-san.

00:21:11.950 --> 00:21:12.910
Eh?!

00:21:12.910 --> 00:21:13.910
Ah! Yes? {shani: is he going to confess now?!}

00:21:14.160 --> 00:21:15.450
Mitsuki-chan...

00:21:15.870 --> 00:21:17.370
I'm counting on you to take care of her.

00:21:17.370 --> 00:21:19.500
S-Sure... {shani: Wakaouji no koto Ooshige ga horechatta zo!}

00:21:20.410 --> 00:21:21.960
Let's do our best, Mitsuki!

00:21:21.960 --> 00:21:22.710
Okay!

00:23:05.680 --> 00:23:07.190
This is great!

00:23:07.190 --> 00:23:10.770
They're finally going to release
 a second single for her!

00:23:10.770 --> 00:23:11.480
Ah.

00:23:11.480 --> 00:23:12.650
A lot's happened, but...

00:23:12.650 --> 00:23:15.280
...everything's all good now. {fine and dandy, yeah...}

00:23:15.280 --> 00:23:16.990
So, what kind of song is it?

00:23:16.990 --> 00:23:19.320
She wants to cover one of her father's songs.

00:23:19.320 --> 00:23:20.320
Is that so?

00:23:20.320 --> 00:23:21.830
Hope it's another hit.

00:23:21.830 --> 00:23:22.870
What are you saying?

00:23:22.870 --> 00:23:24.660
With Meroko taking care of things...

00:23:24.660 --> 00:23:25.830
With Love! Love! Love!

00:23:25.830 --> 00:23:28.580
It'll be a huge hit! No doubt about it!

00:23:28.580 --> 00:23:30.670
Next time on Full Moon wo Sagashite:

00:23:30.670 --> 00:23:32.210
My Father's Song
